.TH OPENHAMSHACK-ATV 1 "2026-10-04" "openhamshack-atv" "User Commands"
.SH NAME
openhamshack-atv \- analogue amateur-television transceiver
.SH SYNOPSIS
.B openhamshack-atv
.RI [ OPTIONS ]
.SH DESCRIPTION
OpenHamShack ATV is a native PyQt6 desktop transceiver for analogue amateur
television: 625-line PAL with sound, as AM-VSB (System I style) or FM-ATV
(IARU R1 V.2 with CCIR 405 pre-emphasis and a 6 MHz sound subcarrier), on
23cm and 6cm, and analogue receive on 70cm. The picture is generated and
decoded in the program; a Pluto-family SDR (ADALM-Pluto, Pluto+, Pluto
nano, LibreSDR) is driven through libiio for both directions.
.PP
With no radio configured it runs against a simulated radio: simulated
stations on the bandplan channels, and its own transmission looped back,
so the whole chain can be explored and tested without hardware. The
simulator transmits nothing.
.PP
A Pluto on USB 2 sustains about 6.8 million samples a second; colour
AM-VSB with sound needs 10 and standard FM-ATV 20, which need a Pluto+ or
LibreSDR on Ethernet. The window states what fits at the chosen rate.
.SH OPTIONS
.TP
.B \-\-headless
Run the engine without a window and print one status line a second.
Nothing in this mode can transmit.
.TP
.BR \-\-device " " sim | pluto
Use this device for this run only (not saved).
.TP
.BR \-\-band " " 70cm | 23cm | 6cm
Start on this band for this run only.
.TP
.BR \-\-system " " am | fm
Start with this system for this run only.
.TP
.BI \-\-seconds " N"
With \-\-headless, stop after N seconds.
.TP
.B \-\-no\-audio
Run without a sound card.
.SH SAFETY
The program never transmits at start-up or after a settings change. A real
radio does not transmit until "Allow transmit on real hardware" is set in
Settings, the licence conditions are acknowledged and a callsign is set; the
callsign is drawn into every transmitted picture. Transmit is refused
outside the UK allocations and ATV bandplan segments (analogue ATV is not in
the 70cm bandplan), outside the radio's tuning range, and when the signal
does not fit the sample rate.
.SH FILES
.TP
.I ~/.config/openhamshack-atv/config.json
Settings (or $OHSATV_CONF).
.TP
.I ~/.local/share/openhamshack-atv/
Snapshots (or $OHSATV_DATA).
.SH SEE ALSO
.BR ffmpeg (1),
.BR iio_info (1)
